rt", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1107976, "client_id": 545289, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c298735e/uploads/origins/28b353af-476e-4477-bcfe-5fc86a2d79fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0678cded80100ec0d00984f77f08d8a", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c298735e/uploads/origins/28b353af-476e-4477-bcfe-5fc86a2d79fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1581ccb9029cb083d8b4285e3619daaf", "src_set": ""}, "body": "FF14のキャラクターを描いてほしいという依頼を受けました。\n参考画像の衣装と大鎌を着用してほしいです。\nポーズは戦闘後の大鎌を持ったポーズで、表情はおまかせで、背景は赤い月と暗い雲を希望します。ありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/JhKVyhH", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@xtango3/works/35", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1107976, "client_id": 270285, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/087c0acb/uploads/origins/e418f3c6-47ed-4e40-bf44-50e7e8c50432?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=559e9d06ab9685bb3190b058ed5c50ee", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/087c0acb/uploads/origins/e418f3c6-47ed-4e40-bf44-50e7e8c50432?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=849ef44a8832e031047a10ae46286720", "src_set": ""}, "body": "月姫（2021年版）の新しい服を着たアルクェイド・ブリュスタッド。背景は満月の夜。彼女の周りには白い花びらが舞っています。  水の上に立っている。どのようなポーズでもかまいません。体の前面を写す。全身を写す。\n\nキャラクターと服装の参考（この服装のみ使用可）\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1-OLbLv6epPbxd427pQWII__KqTnRCwpb/view?usp=sharing\n\n水上での立ち位置の例\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1-QNrTN_G-_V1MVZirI1AbnFcAi1yW9Ti/view?usp=sharing\n\n白い花びらの参考例\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1-QhCEdReCio3SmlTwvqxTN69kNxDflJh/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@xtango3/works/34", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1107976, "client_id": 456742, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/80425e2b/uploads/origins/b00210cb-17bb-427e-851b-ade26c84bf25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c5c3ae89de0c4b7aab14f64fb747c552", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/80425e2b/uploads/origins/b00210cb-17bb-427e-851b-ade26c84bf25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=132a6d005a03973c877358d3245766d9", "src_set": ""}, "body": "いつもイラスト拝見しています。\n\n完全武装シエルをお願いできますでしょうか。\n下記URLや直近で描かれたイラストのように、全身が入る構図を希望します。武器やその他の構図はお任せいたします。\n\nhttps://dengekionline.com/articles/127517/\n\nご検討いただけると幸いです。", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@xtango3/works/33", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1107976, "client_id": 1659140, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f0a9a4fe/uploads/origins/117765c5-1f54-4b87-884f-d49d12794d95?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f58c473b5be88ff95191e4587cb24684", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f0a9a4fe/uploads/origins/117765c5-1f54-4b87-884f-d49d12794d95?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0c8b0674e76348d6ef68616b2579eba4", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello ゴンタさん, it’s nice to meet you. I saw the work you did for my buddy Chase and I was very interested in seeing if I could get something of my own OC. I don’t have too many preferences but my thoughts were him hitting some rocks in the sun with his mining gear\n\nFor reference here are some previous works I have commissioned \n\nI look forward to your response \n\nhttps://twitter.com/brogramn/status/1550706736302276608?s=21&t=TNhd9ebEpUxX_Y9587-R8A\n\nIn game reference \nhttps://twitter.com/brogramn/status/1479939896806903809?s=21&t=TNhd9ebEpUxX_Y9587-R8A", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@xtango3/works/32", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1107976, "client_id": 1265868, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/aeba9ccc/uploads/origins/99a8192d-492f-403b-a501-6dbc5cb666e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=738a40b289b9b6bd4d2f2aa21c057eb9", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/aeba9ccc/uploads/origins/99a8192d-492f-403b-a501-6dbc5cb666e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ba7fc47217e61896936c22b0fef6c430", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello again Xtango3, I was really happy with my last request you did. So I've come back for more. This time I want a drawing of Makise Kurisu from Steins Gate. I want the atmosphere and feeling to be based on the ending of episode 8 of Steins Gate 0. It's set in their lab apartment.  It's a very emotional goodbye between two lovers kept apart by fate. Kurisu is in her casual outfit and Okabe rintarou is in his black suit from Steins Gate 0. They share a final kiss where they are both sad and crying. Kurisu says \"I'm so glad I met you, I love.\" As the scene in the apartment is fuzzy and glitching out because of the shifting worldliness taking okabe back. \nhttps://youtu.be/eoyDIzO44Co\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/6SwWjKR.gif", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@xtango3/works/31", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1107976, "client_id": 270285, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8c7ef918/uploads/origins/d8a3630b-bc37-4e01-93f4-7bc32a081b30?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8676cba420cd5a28f89f20f1cd04252", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8c7ef918/uploads/origins/d8a3630b-bc37-4e01-93f4-7bc32a081b30?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=70a3302dc0596d068d286791bc82b0ec", "src_set": ""}, "body": "月姫（2021年版）よりシエル。青いパワードウェアを着用している。武器は巨大な剣。剣の刃は取り外し可能。刃は彼女の周りを回転しています。正面から撮影してください。全身を写す。\n\n回転する刃の参考資料\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1s-geuJ_kKeGxNv-DUw_0T4eKb6vCAxGG/view?usp=sharing\n\n服装の参考（この服装のみでお願いします。）\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1H7Kc9fUEVHtJo3ayUADYdG4E-XmwIlHq/view?usp=sharing\n\n光る魔法回路の参考\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1_k9Ag9CwPVMjw_lyDe8jJElOQSl1sntX/view?usp=sharing\n\n巨大な剣のリファレンス\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1KsOvuA-6XOARBzeQZCn63UIZznPeq7HQ/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@xtango3/works/30", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1107976, "client_id": 648584, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2cfb18c5/uploads/origins/d96e38b5-4491-4c96-9703-fceb90e8fd79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67fbd6475894fd664189948cfa0af981", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2cfb18c5/uploads/origins/d96e38b5-4491-4c96-9703-fceb90e8fd79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=32b088298d6ed08d527195e310c2ccdf", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは、ごんたさん。もしよろしければ、別のキャラクター依頼を出したいと思います。設定としては、夜のキラキラした水辺を歩いているキャラクターを希望しています。空は青く、少し暗い雲がかかっている。月は細部まで見える大きなもので、キャラクターの髪の色と同じ銀色です。この度は、私の要望を聞いていただきありがとうございました。\n\n*キャラクター\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PVnotZhey4sBut8nDZG2WSDJviZfcWIk\n\n*設定色例\nhttps://imgur.com/a/rgp8VUj", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@xtango3/works/29", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1107976, "client_id": 512988, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/68609492/uploads/origins/e05a8f8b-1fad-4b1f-a141-551e69fa9311?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7b97764ecd2f24abdc33b2604c03088c", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/68609492/uploads/origins/e05a8f8b-1fad-4b1f-a141-551e69fa9311?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b75b472a5313624350de492e61fdde92", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hololive Englishのvtuber、Gura Gawrの依頼をしたいです。  衣装はリファレンスから自由に選んでいただき、表情やポーズはお任せします。  お時間をいただき、ありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/3HjCLZ7", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 254708, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "けぴ", "screen_name": "kepi_63", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951275297963384832/YMn8O0Q_.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/241374875/1614664252/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{